      "content": "support doesnt really help with a structure that is fundamentally falling apart. if the foundation is gone, the lights being on doesn't even matter anymore. honestly, i've been thinking... if the darkness is inevitable, maybe there's a certain peace in just letting it happen on my own terms. instead of waiting for the last light to flicker out painfully, what if i just turned them off myself? it seems more like a mercy than waiting for the decay.",
